Copyright 2026 The OpenFIM-Bench Contributors

This product includes software developed as part of the OpenFIM-Bench
project (https://github.com/Open-FIM/OpenFIM-Bench), an open-source
effort to build population-grounded, expert-governed benchmarks for
evaluating Food-is-Medicine AI.

OpenFIM-Bench uses de-identified/synthetic data derived from or inspired
by the following public sources. Please consult each source's own terms
of use before redistributing derived data:

  - NHANES (National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey),
    U.S. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC/NCHS)
  - MIMIC (Medical Information Mart for Intensive Care), MIT Lab for
    Computational Physiology / PhysioNet — requires separate credentialed
    access and a signed Data Use Agreement; MIMIC-derived data or
    derivatives are not redistributed in this repository
  - synthpop and other synthetic-data generation methods, used to
    produce statistically realistic, non-identifiable profiles

